<title>USA: Innovative machine wins approval in Nevada.</title>
<headline>Innovative machine wins approval in Nevada.</headline>
<dateline>RENO, Nev. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Innovative Gaming Corp of America on Friday said the Nevada Gaming Commission approved its Hot Shot Dice gambling machine.</p>
<p>Nevada regulators also confirmed the company's BJ Blitz and Lightning Strike roulette machines completed field trials. The equipment will be reviewed for approval by the Gaming Control Board and Nevada Gaming Commission on the March 6 and March 20, respectively.</p>
</text>
